                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237722667",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198975092492",
                            "num_reviews": 2,
                            "playtime_forever": 2543,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 2542,
                            "last_played": 1792319674
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game reminds me of something you'd rather leave in your childhood. I turned 20 in August and i feel gut-wrenched when i play or see Gothic 3.\r\nThe OST gets me to my childhood where i went through divorce and poverty, and also gets me through all the times i went to Myrtana after elementary school to escape from the big world to make my problems feel a little smaller. \r\nOn my last playthrough i enjoyed the game like never before... That makes me feel like this game ages like a fine wine.\r\nMaybe Gothic 3 wasn't the finest game at that time for the critics, but it healed something in me, that nothing could in that time.\r\nThank you Gothic and Piranha Bytes.",
